{%- comment -%}
  Return Center (`/return-center`) — the b2b-shop page recreated in the theme.
  The form is hosted by Cognito Forms; the theme only embeds it and prefills the
  dealer identifiers. In b2b-shop the embed markup came from the CMS landing
  page with url handle `return-center`; here the form key/id are theme settings
  so the page is repointable without touching the CMS or the template.

  Shopify has no return-center concept, hence the `aico_` template stem. Login
  is enforced by the storefront catch-all (RequireCustomerLogin).
{%- endcomment -%}

{% render 'aico-cognito-form', form_id: settings.aico_cognito_return_center_form_id %}
